  0 ?do begin $E000E010 @ $10000 and until loop   \ count the wraps  ok.
  0 $E000E010 ! ;                                 \ SysTick off again  ok.
  ok.
: matrix2-sr ( -- u ) matrix2-spi 8 + @ ;         \ SPI1 SR  ok.
: >matrix2 ( b -- )                               \ one byte out  ok.
  begin matrix2-sr 2 and until  matrix2-spi $C + c! ; \ wait for TXE; c! writes one frame  ok.
