  $80 rot 7 and rshift swap cbis! ;               \ bit 7 is the left LED  ok.
: matrix2-show ( -- )                             \ the picture to the LEDs, a row at a time  ok.
  8 0 do  ok.
    matrix2-select  ok.
    1 0 do  j 1+ >matrix2  j 1 * i + matrix2-buf + c@ >matrix2  loop \ register: row + 1; the left chip first  ok.
    matrix2-load  ok.
  loop ;  ok.
  ok.
: matrix2-init ( -- )  ok.
  1 1 lshift $4002104C bis!                       \ RCC AHB2ENR: clock for GPIOB  ok.
  1 12 lshift $40021060 bis!                      \ RCC APB2ENR: clock for SPI1  ok.
  1 12 lshift $40021040 2dup bis! bic!            \ RCC APB2RSTR: reset SPI1, nothing left in it from another part  ok.
