  matrix2-din-af matrix2-din-pin 4 * lshift matrix2-din-port $20 + bis! \ AFRL: AF5 = SPI1 MOSI  ok.
  $1700 matrix2-spi 4 + !                         \ CR2: 8-bit frames  ok.
  $354 matrix2-spi !                              \ CR1: master, SCK = 16 MHz / 8 (it takes 10 MHz), SSM and SSI, on  ok.
