  9 0 matrix2-all                                 \ no decoding: each bit is an LED  ok.
  $B 7 matrix2-all                                \ scan all 8 rows: after power-up only row 0 shows  ok.
  $A 3 matrix2-all                                \ intensity 3 of 15  ok.
  matrix2-clear matrix2-show                      \ its rows hold noise at power-up  ok.
