[chip] MAX7219: the module runs from 5 V and wants at least 3.5 V for a high on DIN, CLK and CS; a 3.3 V pin is below that. It mostly works on the bench; a level shifter makes it sure
#!matrix 1
................................
................................
................................
...#............................
................................
................................
................................
...............................#
Bus	CS PC9 · CLK PC10 · DIN PC12
Chain	4 × MAX7219 · 32 × 8 LEDs
Mode	on
Intensity	3 · 7/32
Scan limit	7 · all 8 rows
Decode	none: each bit an LED
Chips	all set alike
Last	register 8 = 01 on chip 0 · 21 loads
matrix2-init 0 0 matrix2-pixel 7 7 matrix2-pixel matrix2-show  ok.

